{
  "comment": [
    "Who vendors what. One entry per upstream file, listing every repository that",
    "keeps a copy of it. check_consumers.py reads this to answer the question a",
    "per-repo vendoring check cannot: the upstream moved, so who is behind?",
    "",
    "Add a consumer here in the same change that first vendors the file, or the",
    "check is silent about it forever. A missing consumer is the one failure this",
    "registry has, and nothing else can detect it.",
    "",
    "A consumer names either its manifest (a vendored.json recording the sha256 of",
    "its copy) or, where it keeps no manifest, the copy itself: a copy may carry a",
    "comment header above the upstream file, and is current when the upstream bytes",
    "are its tail. external marks a repository someone else owns. One that is behind",
    "is reported and does not fail the check, because the fix is a pull request its",
    "owner has to merge."
  ],
  "upstreams": [
    {
      "name": "qnxprobe",
      "repo": "abrignoni/qnxprobe",
      "file": "qnxprobe.py",
      "consumers": [
        {"repo": "abrignoni/GLEAPP", "manifest": "gleapp/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/VLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/ALEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/DLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/iLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/RLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "stark4n6/Arc2Lite", "manifest": "vendor/vendored.json", "external": true},
        {"repo": "kalink0/crush-forensics", "copy": "crush/third_party/qnxprobe/qnxprobe.py",
         "external": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ewfprobe",
      "repo": "abrignoni/ewfprobe",
      "file": "ewfprobe.py",
      "consumers": [
        {"repo": "abrignoni/GLEAPP", "manifest": "gleapp/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/VLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/qnxprobe", "manifest": "vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/ALEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/DLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/iLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "abrignoni/RLEAPP", "manifest": "scripts/vendor/vendored.json"},
        {"repo": "stark4n6/Arc2Lite", "manifest": "vendor/vendored.json", "external": true},
        {"repo": "kalink0/crush-forensics", "copy": "crush/third_party/ewfprobe/ewfprobe.py",
         "external": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "mediacarve",
      "repo": "abrignoni/mediacarve",
      "file": "mediacarve.py",
      "consumers": [
        {"repo": "abrignoni/GLEAPP", "manifest": "gleapp/vendor/vendored.json"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
